> parse 2x
(2 * x)
> parse 3(x+1)
(3 * (x + 1))
> parse 2 sin x
(2 * sin(x))
> parse sin x^2
sin((x ^ 2))
> parse sin 2x
sin((2 * x))
> parse sin x cos x
(sin(x) * cos(x))
> parse x(y+1)
(x * (y + 1))
  note: x(...) read as multiplication: x is not a function
> parse 2(x)y
((2 * x) * y)
> parse a b c
((a * b) * c)
> parse 3πx
(9.424777961 * x)
> parse 2 sqrt 3
3.464101615
> parse (x+1)(x-1)
((x + 1) * (x - 1))
> parse 2(x+1)(x+2)
((2 * (x + 1)) * (x + 2))
> parse 5 5
25
> parse 2 3x
(6 * x)
> parse x 2
(2 * x)
> parse (sin x)(cos x)
(sin(x) * cos(x))
